<title>UK: Northern loses CE takeover battle.</title>
<headline>Northern loses CE takeover battle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northern Electric Plc lost its independence on Tuesday after a knife-edge hostile takeover tussle with U.S. predator CE Electric.</p>
<p>CE Electric, which is controlled by CalEnergy Co Inc, said that by 1300 GMT on Tuesday it had received valid acceptances of its 782 million pound ($1.31 billion) offer from shareholders representing 50.30 percent of Northern's ordinary issued share capital, giving it victory in the takeover battle.</p>
</text>
